          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma ndelo ario no, wok i ndelo mar'aboro medirok, jocway ri Were i wi migam jolamiyo i wi migam mic awaŋa mewin kodi mic mewin ma siem, aka alajolo, Rwoth Were waco.",
          "type": "text",
